<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WOMENS' DOWNHILL AT WORLD CUP FINALS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WOMENS' DOWNHILL AT WORLD CUP FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overall champion Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden won the women's downhill at the World Cup Finals on Wedensday, according to provisional results. </p>
<p>Renate Goetschl of Austria finished second to clinch the season's downhill title, with Katja Seizinger of Germany taking third.</p>
</text>
